Third-party material in this directory

token/example-ft/src/lib.rs and token/out/fungible_token.wasm
  The fungible-token example of near-sdk-rs, copied unmodified from
  https://github.com/near/near-sdk-rs at commit 1aac824cc543b2f201831f888c85396529716742
  (tag near-sdk-v5.29.0), path examples/fungible-token/ft/src/lib.rs, and the wasm built from it
  with cargo-near (sha256 in token/EXAMPLE_WASM_SHA256). token/example-ft/Cargo.toml replaces the
  example's workspace path dependencies with the crates.io releases of the same tag.
